  "question": {
    "text": "Two particles are simultaneously thrown from the top of two towers as shown. Their velocities are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Horizontal and vertical separations between these particles are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> respectively. Then the minimum separation between the particles in the process of their motion in meters is (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)<br />\r<img alt=\"Picture 331\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/__4__.JPG\" style=\"width: 177px; height: 141px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo></math> relative velocity along x-axis<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo></math> relative velocity along the y-axis<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br />For minimum <math><mi>r</mi></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mrow><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>substituting&nbsp;the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
